<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V BANGLADESH SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V BANGLADESH SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the Asia Cup match</p>
<p>between Sri Lanka and Bangladesh, reduced from 50 to 46 overs</p>
<p>after rain, at the Singahalese Sports Club ground on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka</p>
<p> S.Jayasuriya c Mafizur b Salahuddin    108</p>
<p> M.Atapattu c Aminul b Minhajul	    60</p>
<p> A.de Silva c Mashud b Minhajul	    15</p>
<p> A.Ranatunga c Naimur b Salahuddin	 51</p>
<p> R.Mahanama not out			    39</p>
<p> L.de Silva not out			    10</p>
<p> Extras (lb-4 w-9)			     13</p>
<p> Total (4 wickets - 46 overs)	     296</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-171 2-177 3-213 4-284</p>
<p>Did not bat: U.Chandana, R.Kalpage, D.Liyanage,</p>
<p>M.Muralitharan, S.de Silva</p>
<p>Bowling: Saiful 6-0-34-0 (2w), Hossain 8-0-50-0 (3w),</p>
<p>Mafizur 6-0-37-0 (1w), Akram 2-0-34-0, Salahuddin 8-0-48-2 (2w),</p>
<p>Minhajul 9-0-43-2 (1w), Naimur 7-0-46-0.</p>
<p>Bangladesh</p>
<p> Athar Ali Khan b Muralitharan		    42</p>
<p> Naimur Rahman c Kalpage b S.de Silva	   47</p>
<p> Habibul Bashar run out				6</p>
<p> Aminul Islam run out				 29</p>
<p> Akram Khan st L.de Silva b Chandana	    32</p>
<p> Minhajul Abedin c S.de Silva b Muralitharan   1</p>
<p> Mafizur Rahman c S.de Silva b A.de Silva	6</p>
<p> Khalid Mashud not out				 5</p>
<p> Hasibul Hossain run out			     2</p>
<p> Extras (b-3 lb-6 w-12 nb-2)			23</p>
<p> Total (for 8 wickets in 46 overs)	     193</p>
<p>Did not bat: Shaikh Salahuddin, Saiful Islam</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-76 2-95 3-117 4-167 5-177 6-178  7-190</p>
<p>8-193.</p>
<p>Bowling: Liyange 3-0-10-0 (3w), S.de Silva 4-0-17-1 (1nb</p>
